      "generated_answer": "The study reveals a lack of mandatory outcome feedback in emergency medicine training programs despite high perceived educational value by residents. Since deliberate practice requires structured feedback for skill improvement, the findings suggest an opportunity to incorporate such practices. The significant gap between resident and program director perceptions further supports the need for systematic outcome feedback.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
