      "generated_answer": "The study demonstrates that laparoscopic myomectomy can be performed efficiently regardless of the size, number, and location of myomas, as no exclusion criteria were applied and high success rates were achieved with minimal conversions. Although larger or numerous myomas were associated with increased operating time and blood loss, the outcomes were manageable and did not preclude laparoscopic approach. Therefore, these factors do not form absolute limiting factors.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
