      "generated_answer": "The study shows that loss of DKK3 expression is associated with lymph node metastasis (p<0.001) and that combining DKK3 status with CT imaging improves the accuracy of predicting lymph node involvement in advanced gastric cancer. This suggests DKK3 loss has predictive value when used alongside preoperative CT staging. Therefore, the evidence supports that DKK3 loss can contribute to preoperative prediction of lymph node metastasis.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
