      "generated_answer": "The mouse escapes because Miss Moppet forgets about a hole in the duster she used to tie him up. When she unties the duster, the mouse is gone. He wriggles out through the hole and runs away to dance on top of the cupboard.\n\n\\boxed{The mouse escapes through a hole in the duster that Miss Moppet forgets about.}",
