      "generated_answer": "Dr. Capa travels to Los Angeles to stay with his friend, Dr. Bob Moore, in an effort to restart his life following the depression caused by his patient's suicide.\n\n\\boxed{Dr. Capa travels to Los Angeles to stay with his friend, Dr. Bob Moore, in an effort to restart his life following the depression caused by his patient's suicide.}",
