    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In comparison to Homo habilis, what gave Homo erectus the ability to migrate so far, so fast?\n\nOptions: \nA. microcephaly\nB. larger brain size\nC. ability to swim\nD. ability to communicate\nE. stronger muscles\nF. enhanced vision\nG. neoteny\nH. longer lifespan\nI. bipedalism\nJ. intelligence\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
