      "generated_answer": "The most widely accepted explanation among paleoanthropologists is that the increased cognitive capacity and technical abilities associated with a larger brain allowed *Homo erectus* to adapt to diverse environments and solve complex survival problems. This evolutionary development facilitated the strategic planning and tool use necessary for successful long-distance migration.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
