    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The archaeological record provides evidence of symbolic expression, such as ochre processing and abstract engravings, dating back to at least 75,000 to 100,000 years ago, which predates the arrival of fully behaviorally modern humans in Europe. While the other options are associated with the Neolithic Revolution or the Upper Paleolithic, symbolic art represents the earliest cognitive shift appearing in the Middle Stone Age. Therefore, symbolic expression is the most ancient trait among those listed.\n\n\\boxed{E}",
