      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.readline\n    N, M = map(int, input().split())\n    S = input().strip()\n    \n    plain_used = 0\n    logo_used = 0\n    max_logo = 0\n    \n    for c in S:\n        if c == '0':\n            plain_used = 0\n            logo_used = 0\n        elif c == '1':\n            if plain_used < M:\n                plain_used += 1\n            else:\n                logo_used += 1\n                if logo_used > max_logo:\n                    max_logo = logo_used\n        else:  # c == '2'\n            logo_used += 1\n            if logo_used > max_logo:\n                max_logo = logo_used\n                \n    print(max_logo)\n```",
