    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    n = int(input())\n    a = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    \n    max_diff = 0\n    \n    # Try all possible k values (divisors of n)\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        if n % k != 0:\n            continue\n        num_trucks = n // k\n        truck_weights = []\n        \n        for i in range(num_trucks):\n            start = i * k\n            end = start + k\n            truck_weight = sum(a[start:end])\n            truck_weights.append(truck_weight)\n        \n        diff = max(truck_weights) - min(truck_weights)\n        max_diff = max(max_diff, diff)\n    \n    print(max_diff)\n\nt = int(input())\nfor _ in range(t):\n    solve()\n```",
