      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    t = int(data[0])\n    index = 1\n    results = []\n    \n    for _ in range(t):\n        n = int(data[index])\n        index += 1\n        a = list(map(int, data[index:index + n]))\n        index += n\n        \n        # Precompute prefix sums for efficient range sum queries\n        prefix = [0] * (n + 1)\n        for i in range(n):\n            prefix[i + 1] = prefix[i] + a[i]\n        \n        max_diff = 0\n        \n        # Try all possible k values that divide n\n        for k in range(1, n + 1):\n            if n % k != 0:\n                continue\n            \n            num_trucks = n // k\n            truck_weights = []\n            \n            for i in range(num_trucks):\n                start = i * k\n                end = start + k\n                truck_weight = prefix[end] - prefix[start]\n                truck_weights.append(truck_weight)\n            \n            if len(truck_weights) == 1:\n                diff = 0\n            else:\n                diff = max(truck_weights) - min(truck_weights)\n            \n            if diff > max_diff:\n                max_diff = diff\n        \n        results.append(str(max_diff))\n    \n    print(\"\\n\".join(results))\n\nsolve()\n```",
