      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    n = int(input())\n    events = []\n    for _ in range(n):\n        events.append(list(map(int, input().split())))\n\n    def simulate(picks):\n        potions = {}\n        max_potions = 0\n        pick_idx = 0\n        \n        for i in range(n):\n            t, x = events[i]\n            \n            if t == 1:\n                if picks[pick_idx] == 1:\n                    if x not in potions:\n                        potions[x] = 0\n                    potions[x] += 1\n                pick_idx += 1\n                \n            else:\n                if x not in potions or potions[x] == 0:\n                    return -1, -1\n                else:\n                    potions[x] -= 1\n                    if potions[x] == 0:\n                        del potions[x]\n            \n            current_potions = sum(potions.values()) \n            max_potions = max(max_potions, current_potions)\n            \n        return max_potions, 0\n\n    potion_indices = [i for i in range(n) if events[i][0] == 1]\n    num_potions = len(potion_indices)\n\n    min_k = float('inf')\n    best_picks = None\n    \n    for i in range(2**num_potions):\n        picks = []\n        for j in range(num_potions):\n            if (i >> j) & 1:\n                picks.append(1)\n            else:\n                picks.append(0)\n\n        k, defeated = simulate(picks)\n\n        if k != -1:\n            if k < min_k:\n                min_k = k\n                best_picks = picks\n            elif k == min_k and best_picks is not None:\n                pass #no preferrences on the output\n            elif best_picks is None:\n                min_k = k\n                best_picks = picks\n\n    if min_k == float('inf'):\n        print(\"-1\")\n    else:\n        print(min_k)\n        print(*best_picks)\n\nsolve()\n```",
