      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countSubMultisets(nums, l, r):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    from collections import Counter\n    \n    cnt = Counter(nums)\n    dp = [0] * (r + 1)\n    dp[0] = 1\n    \n    for num, freq in cnt.items():\n        if num == 0:\n            dp[0] = (dp[0] * (freq + 1)) % MOD\n            continue\n        for s in range(r, -1, -1):\n            if dp[s] == 0:\n                continue\n            for k in range(1, min(freq + 1, (r - s) // num + 1)):\n                if s + k * num <= r:\n                    dp[s + k * num] = (dp[s + k * num] + dp[s]) % MOD\n    \n    return sum(dp[l:r+1]) % MOD\n```",
