    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    n, m = map(int, input().split())\n    if n > 1:\n        parents = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    else:\n        if m > 0:\n            for _ in range(m):\n                input()\n        print(1)\n        return\n    \n    insurances = []\n    for _ in range(m):\n        x, y = map(int, input().split())\n        insurances.append((x, y))\n    \n    covered = set()\n    \n    def get_descendants(person, generations):\n        descendants = set()\n        q = [(person, 0)]\n        \n        while q:\n            curr_person, curr_gen = q.pop(0)\n            \n            if curr_person not in descendants:\n                descendants.add(curr_person)\n            \n            if curr_gen < generations:\n                for i in range(n - 1):\n                    if parents[i] == curr_person:\n                        q.append((i + 2, curr_gen + 1))\n        return descendants\n\n    for x, y in insurances:\n        covered = covered.union(get_descendants(x, y))\n    \n    print(len(covered))\n\nsolve()\n```",
