      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    N = int(next(it))\n    M = int(next(it))\n    \n    parent = [0] * (N + 1)\n    children = [[] for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    for i in range(2, N + 1):\n        p = int(next(it))\n        parent[i] = p\n        children[p].append(i)\n    \n    max_ins = [-1] * (N + 1)\n    for _ in range(M):\n        x = int(next(it))\n        y = int(next(it))\n        if y > max_ins[x]:\n            max_ins[x] = y\n    \n    depth = [-1] * (N + 1)\n    depth[1] = 0\n    bfs_order = [1]\n    idx = 0\n    while idx < len(bfs_order):\n        u = bfs_order[idx]\n        idx += 1\n        for c in children[u]:\n            depth[c] = depth[u] + 1\n            bfs_order.append(c)\n    \n    curr_max = [-1] * (N + 1)\n    covered = 0\n    cm_root = max_ins[1]  # depth[1] is 0\n    curr_max[1] = cm_root\n    if cm_root >= 0:\n        covered += 1\n        \n    for u in bfs_order[1:]:\n        p = parent[u]\n        cm = curr_max[p]\n        val = max_ins[u] + depth[u]\n        if val > cm:\n            cm = val\n        curr_max[u] = cm\n        if cm >= depth[u]:\n            covered += 1\n            \n    print(covered)\n```",
