    "prediction": "gemini-2.5-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    def gcd(a, b):\n        if b == 0:\n            return a\n        return gcd(b, a % b)\n\n    def can_traverse_all_pairs(nums):\n        n = len(nums)\n        if n <= 1:\n            return True\n\n        parent = list(range(n))\n        rank = [0] * n\n\n        def find(i):\n            if parent[i] == i:\n                return i\n            parent[i] = find(parent[i])\n            return parent[i]\n\n        def union(i, j):\n            root_i = find(i)\n            root_j = find(j)\n            if root_i != root_j:\n                if rank[root_i] < rank[root_j]:\n                    parent[root_i] = root_j\n                elif rank[root_i] > rank[root_j]:\n                    parent[root_j] = root_i\n                else:\n                    parent[root_j] = root_i\n                    rank[root_i] += 1\n                return True\n            return False\n\n        for i in range(n):\n            for j in range(i + 1, n):\n                if gcd(nums[i], nums[j]) > 1:\n                    union(i, j)\n\n        count = 0\n        for i in range(n):\n            if parent[i] == i:\n                count += 1\n        \n        root0 = find(0)\n        for i in range(1,n):\n            if find(i) != root0:\n                return False\n\n        return True\n\n    return can_traverse_all_pairs\n```",
